WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.120
Welcome back, champ!

2
00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:14.260
Last time: chatbots predict · keep info private

3
00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:19.070
Chapter 4 · Faces, Filters, and Fun

4
00:00:19.070 --> 00:00:32.160
How does the phone know where to put them?

5
00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:38.350
Meet Kabir, on a birthday video call

6
00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:46.870
Pop! Puppy ears and a tongue!

7
00:00:46.870 --> 00:00:54.210
He turns his head. The ears follow!

8
00:00:54.210 --> 00:01:04.750
How does the phone know? A tiny artist?

9
00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:14.270
No artist, no magic. A program finding patterns!

10
00:01:14.270 --> 00:01:25.440
AR filter: adds fun things on top of the picture

11
00:01:25.440 --> 00:01:34.690
Real picture below · fun drawings on top

12
00:01:34.690 --> 00:01:40.170
Filter = find the face + draw on top

13
00:01:40.170 --> 00:01:51.650
Step 1: find the face in the picture

14
00:01:51.650 --> 00:02:01.870
Step 2: mark points · eyes · nose · mouth · head

15
00:02:01.870 --> 00:02:11.940
Step 3: ears on head points, glasses on eyes

16
00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:18.570
No face found? Nowhere to put the ears!

17
00:02:18.570 --> 00:02:30.330
It finds face points again, many times a second

18
00:02:30.330 --> 00:02:42.600
Points move → ears move. Like a flipbook!

19
00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:56.380
Uh-oh! Glasses on Meera's forehead. Why?

20
00:02:56.380 --> 00:03:04.610
Poor light → wrong eye points → wrong spot

21
00:03:04.610 --> 00:03:16.200
Half the face hidden? Not enough points!

22
00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:27.300
Not magic: hidden patterns cause mistakes

23
00:03:27.300 --> 00:03:47.320
Put the filter steps in order!

24
00:03:47.320 --> 00:03:57.500
B → C → A: Find · Mark · Draw

25
00:03:57.500 --> 00:04:06.910
The camera still takes your face picture

26
00:04:06.910 --> 00:04:13.810
A face picture is personal, even with a filter

27
00:04:13.810 --> 00:04:25.290
Beauty filters aren't real. You're great as you are!

28
00:04:25.290 --> 00:04:41.420
Post Meera's filtered photo without asking?

29
00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:50.870
Still her face. Always ask first!

30
00:04:50.870 --> 00:05:04.440
Ask first · Be kind · Grown-up OK for new apps

31
00:05:04.440 --> 00:05:08.390
Your turn: practice check

32
00:05:08.390 --> 00:05:18.730
What must a filter find before adding ears?

33
00:05:18.730 --> 00:05:28.780
Your face and its points, like the head top!

34
00:05:28.780 --> 00:05:33.770
Filter = find the face + draw on top

35
00:05:33.770 --> 00:05:37.880
It needs face points first

36
00:05:37.880 --> 00:05:41.740
The camera still takes your face picture

37
00:05:41.740 --> 00:05:44.790
Ask before posting someone's photo

38
00:05:44.790 --> 00:05:50.250
Chapter 4 done!

39
00:05:50.250 --> 00:05:57.050
Next: Quiz · Tap Finish
